## What success would be measured by

Aescia pilot evaluations are designed to generate evidence across the following domains:

- **Engagement and adherence** — proportion of patients completing daily check-ins, drop-off patterns
- **Escalation signal quality** — proportion of escalated cases reviewed, clinician agreement with urgency classification
- **Clinical safety signals** — unplanned presentations, readmissions, adverse events in the evaluation period
- **Workflow integration** — clinical team time-on-task, worklist adoption, process feedback
- **Patient experience** — acceptability, burden, and satisfaction with the monitoring model

Evaluation endpoints, reporting format, and data governance are agreed in advance. Where permitted, neutral or negative findings will be shared.

